<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-05-14T08:14:46+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Thu, 14 May 2026 08:14:46 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['Home Alone' at White House: Vance jokes as Trump visits China for key talks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/131080680.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Vice President J.D. Vance likened his solitary White House presence to Macaulay Culkin in "Home Alone" due to Secret Service rules preventing him from traveling with President Trump. Vance also cautioned that federal funding for state health insurance programs could be halted if they don't cooperate with the administration's fraud crackdown.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/home-alone-at-white-house-vance-jokes-as-trump-visits-china-for-key-talks/articleshow/131080680.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/home-alone-at-white-house-vance-jokes-as-trump-visits-china-for-key-talks/articleshow/131080680.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-14T08:10:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-131080756,imgsize-1012990.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA["I don’t like it": Donald Trump slams NFL over streaming shift, warns league is 'killing the golden goose' with digital push]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/131070916.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Donald Trump has criticized the NFL’s growing shift toward streaming platforms and fragmented broadcast rights, arguing that it risks limiting access for ordinary fans. In a recent Full Measure interview, he warned that rising costs and multiple subscriptions could alienate viewers and even harm the league’s long-term popularity. While the Department of Justice investigates the NFL’s media distribution practices, Trump stopped short of calling for intervention but expressed clear discomfort with the current direction.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/nfl/news/i-dont-like-it-donald-trump-slams-nfl-over-streaming-shift-warns-league-is-killing-the-golden-goose-with-digital-push/articleshow/131070916.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/nfl/news/i-dont-like-it-donald-trump-slams-nfl-over-streaming-shift-warns-league-is-killing-the-golden-goose-with-digital-push/articleshow/131070916.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-14T05:33:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prantik Prabal Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-131070958,imgsize-101534.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What is Trisha Paytas and James Charles feud? YouTuber faces backlash after Spirit Airlines rant controversy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/131079628.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Trisha Paytas publicly criticized James Charles after his deleted TikTok rant about a former Spirit Airlines employee asking for GoFundMe help. Their latest clash has brought attention back to their years-long feud, including past accusations, online fights, and harsh public statements that once again sparked strong reactions across social media platforms.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/what-is-trisha-paytas-and-james-charles-feud-youtuber-faces-backlash-after-spirit-airlines-rant-controversy/articleshow/131079628.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/what-is-trisha-paytas-and-james-charles-feud-youtuber-faces-backlash-after-spirit-airlines-rant-controversy/articleshow/131079628.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-14T05:36:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-131079623,imgsize-1074695.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Aysia Collins? D4vd’s alleged girlfriend breaks silence Celeste Rivas theories intensify]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/131079588.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Aysia Collins, a California-based influencer allegedly linked to D4vd, has become a major topic in online discussions surrounding the Celeste Rivas case. Viral screenshots, livestream clips, and fan theories pushed her name across social media platforms. Collins later addressed the rumours in a Reddit post, claiming she was “no longer friends with David” and wanted “justice for Celeste Rivas.” Despite growing speculation, there is currently no public evidence showing Collins has been charged or formally accused.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-aysia-collins-d4vds-alleged-girlfriend-breaks-silence-celeste-rivas-theories-intensify/articleshow/131079588.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-aysia-collins-d4vds-alleged-girlfriend-breaks-silence-celeste-rivas-theories-intensify/articleshow/131079588.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-14T06:12:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Barsha Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-131079588,imgsize-68388.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[ChudTheBuilder dragged into shocking Tennessee courthouse shooting as alleged racist altercation turns violent suddenly]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/131079642.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Streamer Dalton Eatherly, known as ChudTheBuilder, was reportedly involved in a courthouse shooting in Clarksville, Tennessee. Social media claims an altercation led to an accidental gun discharge, but police have not confirmed the details yet. The incident happened just days after the streamer’s arrest at a Nashville restaurant over an unpaid bill dispute.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/chudthebuilder-dragged-into-shocking-tennessee-courthouse-shooting-as-alleged-racist-altercation-turns-violent-suddenly/articleshow/131079642.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/chudthebuilder-dragged-into-shocking-tennessee-courthouse-shooting-as-alleged-racist-altercation-turns-violent-suddenly/articleshow/131079642.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-14T05:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><encl